OL,3,APercy Jackson returns as teen stars    
OL,4,Aadapt to life in the limelight         
OL,6,FPercy Jackson is no ordinary teenager -
OL,7,Fand neither is the actor tasked with   
OL,8,Fbringing the character to life.        
OL,10,FAs the son of Greek god Poseidon, Percy
OL,11,Fhas demigod status in the hit Disney   
OL,12,Fseries and while Walker Scobell doesn't
OL,13,Fhave his powers, that hasn't made the  
OL,14,Factor's career any less special.       
OL,16,FThe TV series, based on the novels by  
OL,17,FRick Riordan, sets figures from Greek  
OL,18,Fmythology and their children in the    
OL,19,Fmodern day and returns on Friday for   
OL,20,Fits third instalment - The Titan's     
OL,21,FCurse.                                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
