OL,3,APercy Jackson returns as teen stars    
OL,4,Aadapt to life in the limelight         
OL,6,FScobell was 14 when he made his debut  
OL,7,Fas Percy in 2023. Now 17, the US actor 
OL,8,Fsays growing up in the spotlight has   
OL,9,Fbeen an adventure in itself.           
